<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Serbian police helicopter crashes.</title>
<headline>Serbian police helicopter crashes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Serbian police helicopter crashed into the Danube River near the Belgrade city centre late on Wednesday, injuring at least one man, the state-run news agency Tanjug reported.</p>
<p>The helicopter with four people aboard ditched after its engine failed, Tanjug quoted the Serbian Ministry of Internal Affairs as saying.</p>
<p>Fishermen rescued one man and the search for the other three was continuing.</p>
</text>
